---
title: "transferInvestorPosition (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: not Legion operator
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_from: authorized
    q_check_from --> q_check_to: fromInvestor has position with totalInvested > 0
    q_check_from --> q_revert_no_position: no position to transfer
    q_revert_no_position --> [*]: revert NoPositionFound
    q_check_to --> q_transfer_position: toInvestor has no existing position
    q_check_to --> q_revert_existing: toInvestor already has position
    q_revert_existing --> [*]: revert PositionAlreadyExists
    q_transfer_position --> q_clear_old: copy position data to toInvestor
    q_clear_old --> q_emit: clear fromInvestor position
    q_emit --> [*]: emit PositionTransferred(from, to)

    note right of q_transfer_position
        INV-001: Only Legion operators can transfer positions
        INV-002: Target investor must not have existing position
        INV-003: Source position fully cleared after transfer
        INV-004: Total sale metrics unchanged by transfer
    end note
